<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.3 pct in Dec 21-31.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.3 pct in Dec 21-31.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.3 percent in December 21-31 after rising 0.3 percent in the previous 10 days and were 2.5 percent higher than in the November 21-30 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				  DEC 21-31   DEC 11-20    LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.3	   0.3	  2.5 (2.1)</p>
<p> Bread				0.1	   0.2	  0.3 (1.5)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	   1.6	   1.4	 20.6 (20.0)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.1	  -0.1	 -0.5 (-0.8)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.2	   0.5	  1.4 (0.9)</p>
<p> Eggs				 0.7	   0.6	  2.1 (2.7)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets, figures for the previous 30-day period ending on November 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
